  "notes": "{注|つ}ぐ means to pour liquid, especially drinks, into a container.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle: ⟦お{茶|ちゃ}→お茶：00576_ocha⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{注|つ}ぐ\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦お{茶|ちゃ}→お茶：00576_ocha⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{注|つ}ぐ: to pour tea\n- ⟦コーヒー→コーヒー：00789_koohii⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{注|つ}ぐ: to pour coffee\n- ⟦グラス→グラス：00076_gurasu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{注|つ}ぐ: to pour into a glass\n- ⟦お{酒|さけ}→お酒：01045_osake⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{注|つ}いで⟦あげる→あげる：00546_ageru⟧: to pour sake for someone\n\nALTERNATE READING:\n⟦{注|そそ}ぐ→注ぐ：02124_sosogu⟧ is an alternate reading with similar meaning but also extends to \"pouring\" attention or effort.\n\nHOMOPHONE DISTINCTION:\n- {注|つ}ぐ: to pour (liquids)\n- ⟦{継|つ}ぐ→継ぐ：02292_tsugu⟧: to succeed, inherit\n- ⟦{次|つ}ぐ→次ぐ：02076_tsugu⟧: to rank next to\n- ⟦{接|つ}ぐ→接ぐ：02471_tsugu⟧: to join, graft",
